  "description": "Kanject Core events — the in-process default IEventPublisher: handlers run before PublishAsync completes, in registration order, each in its own DI scope; a failing handler is logged (KANEVT062) or, with HandlerFailureMode.Throw, reported after every handler ran. AddEvents() registers it unless the host chose another transport, plus typed (On(definition).Handle<T>()) and raw (OnTopic / OnAnyTopic) handler registration. Contracts in Kanject.Core.Events.Abstractions.",
